<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal futures trade halted by technical problem.</title>
<headline>Portugal futures trade halted by technical problem.</headline>
<dateline>OPORTO, Portugal 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade in Portuguese bond and stock futures on the Oporto Derivatives Exchange was halted on Thursday by technical problems, an Exchange spokesman said.</p>
<p>The spokesman said that the Exchange hoped business could begin at 1015 GMT.</p>
</text>
